# Airlock AI Governance — .cursorindexingignore
# Soft block: excluded from codebase search/index, but still readable via @file.
# Use for large files the agent rarely needs but you may @-mention on demand.

# ─── Lock files (large, regenerable; @-mention when bumping deps) ─────────────
poetry.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# ─── Evaluation & training artifacts (regenerable via ML pipeline) ──────────
detection/ml/evaluation/
detection/ml/evaluation/*.json
detection/ml/evaluation/*.md
detection/ml/models/*_meta.json

# ─── Helm chart rendered output (templates are source of truth) ───────────────
# (none yet — add if you introduce helm render output)

# ─── Chrome extension packaged builds ─────────────────────────────────────────
extensions/**/dist/
extensions/**/*.crx
extensions/**/*.zip

# ─── Demo / script output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.svg
**/*.ico
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
**/*.ttf
**/*.eot

# ─── Test fixture dumps (keep tests/indexed; exclude bulky fixtures) ──────────
tests/fixtures/
tests/**/*.jsonl
tests/**/*.csv
